@startuml
' Title: Figure 1. V2 Artifact Architecture
' View: context
' Question: How do the DIM, application profile, OGC binding, and implementation relate?
' Layer: mixed-explicit
' Status: approved-for-current-draft
' Source artifact: Sensor_Systems_DIM_and_Profile_V2_Working_Draft_v0.1_25OCT2026
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #EEF5FC
  BorderColor #15233D
  FontColor #15233D
}
title Figure 1. V2 Artifact Architecture

rectangle "Domain Information Model (DIM)\nDefines domain concepts, relationships, and meaning" as DIM
rectangle "Application Profile\nSelects and constrains DIM content for a specific interoperability purpose" as PROFILE
rectangle "OGC Binding\nSpecifies representation using CSAPI, SensorML, SWE Common, and related mechanisms" as BINDING
rectangle "Implementation\nRealizes the binding in servers, adapters, clients, validators, storage, and UIs" as IMPL

DIM --> PROFILE : supplies semantics to
PROFILE ..> DIM : profile requirements identify\nneeded domain questions
PROFILE --> BINDING : selects / constrains; binds to
BINDING --> IMPL : implemented by

note bottom of IMPL
Purpose-driven but binding-independent:
model for the profile, not to the profile.
end note
@enduml
